			<Comment>♂
・ストッパー
　クリアまで
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T06:02:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
