	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01r0201_ol_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せんせい！▼
わたしは　この　どうぐを
この　トレーナーに　あげます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:25:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>宣誓！▼
わたしは　この道具を
この　トレーナーに　あげます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T05:57:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手処理
　No217「せんせいのツメ」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ＯＬ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:22:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:06:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01r0201_ol_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せんせいのツメ　を
ポケモンに　もたせておけば▼
ときどきだけど　あいてより　はやく
わざを　だせるように　なるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:25:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>せんせいのツメ　を
ポケモンに　持たせておけば▼
ときどきだけど　相手より　早く
技を　だせるように　なるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:25:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:21:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ＯＬ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T05:22:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:06:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
