				Time="2011-11-11T05:46:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>の　[Digit:1digit Idx="0" ]カ所　ですね！▼
では　巡って　巡って
ヒウンラリー！　レッツ　ゴー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T05:46:22" />
